{"mode":"words","text":"Oben siehst du einen Text genau so, wie ihn dir die App zeigt. Jedes Wort ist eine kleine Karte: oben das Wort in deiner Zielsprache, darunter seine Bedeutung in deiner Muttersprache — Wort für Wort, in der Reihenfolge der Zielsprache. Darunter steht der ganze Satz noch einmal flüssig übersetzt. Bei Sprachen mit anderer Schrift kommt eine Zeile mit der Umschrift dazu, damit du alles lesen kannst. Tippe auf ein Wort: Die Stimme spielt genau ab dort weiter.","words":[{"s":0,"e":360},{"s":569,"e":813},{"s":836,"e":882},{"s":952,"e":1161},{"s":1207,"e":1509},{"s":1544,"e":1881},{"s":1962,"e":2438},{"s":2589,"e":2717},{"s":2775,"e":2868},{"s":2902,"e":3007},{"s":3042,"e":3135},{"s":3181,"e":3332},{"s":3425,"e":3947},{"s":4331,"e":4667},{"s":4737,"e":5074},{"s":5457,"e":5654},{"s":5700,"e":5851},{"s":5886,"e":6177},{"s":6235,"e":6827},{"s":7338,"e":7581},{"s":7616,"e":7755},{"s":7837,"e":8185},{"s":8510,"e":8638},{"s":8673,"e":8893},{"s":8963,"e":10019},{"s":10194,"e":10751},{"s":10995,"e":11250},{"s":11297,"e":11831},{"s":11889,"e":11959},{"s":11993,"e":12202},{"s":12237,"e":12980},{"s":13131,"e":13236},{"s":13561,"e":13816},{"s":13874,"e":13990},{"s":14025,"e":14478},{"s":14594,"e":14710},{"s":14745,"e":14850},{"s":14908,"e":15511},{"s":15558,"e":15651},{"s":15709,"e":16661},{"s":17172,"e":17624},{"s":17659,"e":17926},{"s":17961,"e":18054},{"s":18089,"e":18379},{"s":18425,"e":18727},{"s":18936,"e":19122},{"s":19168,"e":19459},{"s":19494,"e":19888},{"s":19935,"e":20701},{"s":21398,"e":21525},{"s":21548,"e":21990},{"s":22024,"e":22141},{"s":22187,"e":22501},{"s":22535,"e":22918},{"s":23162,"e":23406},{"s":23441,"e":23592},{"s":23661,"e":23975},{"s":24021,"e":24138},{"s":24161,"e":24242},{"s":24300,"e":24695},{"s":24718,"e":25206},{"s":25322,"e":25577},{"s":25600,"e":25670},{"s":25751,"e":26007},{"s":26076,"e":26366},{"s":26424,"e":26982},{"s":27794,"e":28108},{"s":28154,"e":28282},{"s":28363,"e":28444},{"s":28514,"e":28967},{"s":29118,"e":29246},{"